sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant NotebookCtrl as NotebookReconciler<br/>notebook-controller
    participant ODHCtrl as OpenshiftNotebookReconciler<br/>odh-notebook-controller
    participant CullingCtrl as CullingReconciler
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>openshift-ingress
    participant DSPA as DataSciencePipelines<br/>Application CR

    Note over User,DSPA: Notebook Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl create Notebook CR
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: Admission request (CREATE)
    MutWH->>MutWH: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>Inject proxy env vars<br/>Resolve ImageStream refs<br/>Set reconciliation-lock annotation
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook CR

    K8sAPI->>ValWH: Admission request (CREATE)
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Validated

    K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook created

    K8sAPI->>NotebookCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created
    NotebookCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet
    NotebookCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Service

    K8sAPI->>ODHCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created
    ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>/notebook/{namespace}/{name}
    ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ReferenceGrant<br/>cross-namespace backend ref
    ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>workbench isolation

    ODHCtrl->>DSPA: Check for dspa instance
    alt DSPA exists in namespace
        DSPA-->>ODHCtrl: DSPA config
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Elyra pipeline secret
    end

    ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Release reconciliation lock

    Note over User,DSPA: Ingress Routing Flow

    User->>Gateway: HTTPS request<br/>/notebook/{namespace}/{name}
    Gateway->>Gateway: HTTPRoute path match
    Gateway->>K8sAPI: Forward to notebook Service<br/>cross-namespace backend ref
    K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook UI response

    Note over User,DSPA: Idle Culling Flow

    loop Periodic check
        CullingCtrl->>K8sAPI: Check pod activity timestamps
        alt Workbench idle > threshold
            CullingCtrl->>K8sAPI: Delete pod via StatefulSet scale
            CullingCtrl->>K8sAPI: Annotate Notebook CR<br/>stopped status
        end
    end
